FocAIRemover
============

This project is MIT-licensed. Cleaning algorithms, format dispatch, and the
HTTP API contract are derived from watermarks-remover; the UI pattern is
inspired by (not affiliated with) unmark-web. This repository does not vendor
the upstream Python tree.

